# Local-only, machine-private modules — never committed. Used for personal
# integrations (e.g. driving desktop scripts) that shouldn't ship publicly.
# The server auto-loads server/routes/*.local.js; the client auto-loads
# client/src/components/*.local.jsx via import.meta.glob (absent → no-op).
*.local.js
*.local.jsx
*.local.sh

# 本地问题追踪 / 经验 / 项目内部文档(含 bot 细节、签名口令等,不进公开版)
ISSUES_TRACKING.local.md
LEARNINGS.md
PROJECT.md
*.local.md
.devflow/
.learnings/
# 上面这些私有文件的备份(常带时间戳后缀)同样不进公开仓;
# tests/unit/check-r175-no-private-tracked.mjs 按文件名形态看守已跟踪的文件。
*.bak
*.bak-*

# python 字节码(computer-use helper)
__pycache__/

# 其他工具的笔记目录(非本项目产物;防发版脚本 git add -A 误带)
